  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I tend to use my tablet a lot as a cursor because I have a laptop with no mouse and as someone who likes to draw a lot I thought it would be cool to draw with my tablet on vrchat but my tablet does not respond at all in the app.  I was wondering if that option could possibly be implemented into vrchat?\n\nedit: pen pressure is not what I care about , i seriously just want to use my tablet as a cursor option.",
